;; module-members-skip-effect-row-checking (third hole): effect_check's
;; binding->FnDef index was a fixed 1024-slot array that dropped entries once
;; full, and a callee missing from it contributes only its DECLARED row.  This
;; program has more than 1024 functions (the prelude's plus 1100 fillers), so
;; `noisy` -- unannotated, printing, defined last -- used to fall off the end:
;; `quiet` called it under #fx{} and was accepted.  The index grows now.

